<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-28T05:59:35.563Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 05:59:35 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen have intensified attacks in northern Nigeria, killing multiple civilians in Plateau and abducting residents from Kaduna's Millennium City estate. Bandits stormed the Kaduna estate again, taking six people, while soldiers repelled attacks in Benue and recovered rifles. A large-scale assault in northeastern Nigeria resulted in at least 62 deaths. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNaTZHekRTSzFOQThfNS00SWJLT1hjNlRPdHIzTl9KbWh1b1lkR1dYcTBhZXdfSloyZERTX2ZMV1ZmZXpXZW5qZE95bXRqOGIwSDBPTzdldXBqYS14eWhwWFhUdzUwLWNiRDNvenZXb0F2UWJVMXNnMVJYb2JXeFc2dzl6VEQ4a3VRcTBnUURB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNTnRKbF9zaV91aVhVa2paT1A3TTRBZFBsaThqenNjcVJYZFpJcVNGUVdybkVDZk81U2dEVENHekVZMUZjODBld3MtZnJfenhvWE9zSFlLMmM2UUdmVTdKMzhZTHRrTDU5NXFNdXowSXFiNUFkSklodjN5a2d6Rk0tTGl6UEtkcUMzOV9NalhRVFNJcC1RMjducjl1VmJNZHBjdlZNNThXTW9SMkJvbWljNkh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPb0d6UDlNblo0cHJ3Sl85VDcyS09yWGRuWXRmVjZTS1lZdnh1d19uSnFyWmE0SmwxZVRqcEM1a3psWm1LX2xnaVhmYmMyQUR6RnJkWk9obDRrVk1pWExfMTNBTFhKYkN5cTlWbmVPdk5PZHQxM2xjUno3WXlQbVV0M2pmZDFnTzZVVzlpWkYwWmJxU2tz?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tribune Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxORFI0QnFXdXFZVHJCOGdCWFNQTGJQcUdja2d2V00wZER1cHRmWkc1ODVZeHNob1YxZlQ1NVh2ZlVwV1J5b1hGTTBZOHFraDluQ1ZvSnlFRmp5NzhvSGJfSHkycWdMdGFkdENLcEFjQ2J4RllydTNpaGU1TGZPejVnS1V5YUZLTTdnUlhtMFhIUm9PbGo5NjFn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Legit News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lx